<title>SPAIN: Spain 6-mth T-bill yield falls to 5.009 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain 6-mth T-bill yield falls to 5.009 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain announced the following results at today's Treasury debt auction (amounts bid, allocated in billions of pesetas):</p>
<p>ISSUE Yield Pvs Price Pvs Bid Allocated</p>
<p> 6-mo   5.009  5.217    97.53  97.43    553.8    252.0</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
